51a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>Success snapshots</p><h2 class=\"text-balance text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">Measured where the business feels it.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-background/15 bg-background/5 p-6\"><p class=\"text-3xl font-semibold text-primary\">38% faster intake</p><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-semibold text-background\">Atlas Care Command Center</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-background/60\">A coordinated patient operations platform for a multi-location care network.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-background/15 bg-background/5 p-6\"><p class=\"text-3xl font-semibold text-primary\">64% less review time</p><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-semibold text-background\">Northstar Risk Cloud</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-background/60\">An auditable risk workflow and analytics platform built for a growing fintech.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-background/15 bg-background/5 p-6\"><p class=\"text-3xl font-semibold text-primary\">23% fewer stockouts</p><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-semibold text-background\">Meridian Retail OS</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-background/60\">Unified inventory, store performance, and customer intelligence across 84 locations.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad\"><div class=\"container-site\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-primary p-8 text-primary-foreground sm:p-12 lg:flex lg:items-center lg:justify-between lg:p-16\"><div class=\"hero-grid absolute inset-0 opacity-20\"></div><div class=\"relative max-w-2xl\"><h2 class=\"text-balance text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl\">Build an outcome worth talking about.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-pretty leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75